Package: jarvis-helper
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Muhammad AbdElHay <mmAbdelhay@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: dbus, dbus-bin, polkitd, systemd, apt, flatpak, udisks2, passwd, dosfstools, exfatprogs, e2fsprogs, util-linux, libpam-modules
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/mmAbdelhay/jarvis
Description: Jarvis privileged helper (system D-Bus os.jarvis.Helper1)
 Runs a fixed set of validated operations as root for the Jarvis tools:
 APT and Flathub install/remove, restarts of allowlisted services, and
 adding or removing users and formatting removable drives. Admin operations
 verify the calling user's secret adminPassword through jarvis-admin PAM.
 Started on demand by D-Bus activation; guarded by polkit and, for admin operations, PAM.
